# The Temple of Uggalepih (Zilart 4, mission.zilart.the_temple_of_uggalepih): Norg's Gilgamesh plays 8, Kazham's Jakoh
# Wahcondalo 115. The Sacrificial Chamber zone-in plays nothing at status 0. At status 1 (set by a GM here; the fight's
# 32001 sets it in battlefield.temple_of_uggalepih) it plays 7; its update on option 0 answers (0, 23, 1756, 0, 163);
# its finish sets status 2; the next tick moves the char (0x00B). At status 2 the zone-in plays 8 (the same update); its
# finish completes the mission: the Dark Fragment (KEYITEM_OBTAINED 6398), the Bearer of the Wisewoman's Hope title, the
# Sacrificial Chamber Key taken, Headstone Pilgrimage current; the RoV log (A Rhapsody for the Ages) is left alone.
# Rezoned, nothing plays; _4j0 says NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY (7256, the battlefield framework's refusal) and 32767
# (DefaultActions' messageSpecial -1).
lists Norg/Gilgamesh/onTrigger Kazham/Jakoh_Wahcondalo/onTrigger SacrificialChamber/onZoneIn/1 SacrificialChamber/onEventUpdate/7 SacrificialChamber/onEventUpdate/8 SacrificialChamber/onEventFinish/7 SacrificialChamber/onEventFinish/8 SacrificialChamber/_4j0/onTrigger SacrificialChamber/_4j0/onTrade SacrificialChamber/onEventUpdate/32000 SacrificialChamber/onEventFinish/32000 SacrificialChamber/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=Norg pos=120,-8,-12 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart TheTempleOfUggalepih current
keyitem SacrificialChamberKey
login
trigger Gilgamesh                       # 8
finish
warp 103,-15,-113 Kazham
trigger Jakoh_Wahcondalo                # 115
finish
warp 299,0.1,349 SacrificialChamber     # status 0: no zone-in event
missionstatus Zilart 1                  # a GM (the fight's 32001 sets it: battlefield.temple_of_uggalepih)
rezone open                             # status 1: 7 left open
update 7 option=0                       # option 0: the update
finish                                  # status 2; the next tick moves the char (0x00B)
tick 400
login open                              # status 2: 8 left open
update 8 option=0                       # option 0: the update
finish                                  # completed, the key taken; RoV untouched
rezone                                  # completed: nothing
trigger _4j0                            # not current: NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY, 32767
